  "contentPlaintext": "<bold>Product Requirements Document (PRD)</bold>\n<bold><textStyle color=\"\" fontFamily=\"\" fontSize=\"null\">Product Name:</textStyle></bold> [Insert Product Name]\n<bold><textStyle color=\"\" fontFamily=\"\" fontSize=\"null\">Epic / Feature Title:</textStyle></bold> [Insert Feature Name, e.g., Core API Analytics Dashboard]\n<bold><textStyle color=\"\" fontFamily=\"\" fontSize=\"null\">Document Version:</textStyle></bold> 1.0.0-Baseline\n<bold><textStyle color=\"\" fontFamily=\"\" fontSize=\"null\">Date of Creation:</textStyle></bold> May 28, 2026\n<bold><textStyle color=\"\" fontFamily=\"\" fontSize=\"null\">Document Owner:</textStyle></bold> [Insert Product Manager Name]\n<bold>1. Table of Contents</bold>\n1. Table of Contents\n2. Executive Summary & Success Metrics\n2.1 Problem Statement & Context\n2.2 Product Vision & Strategic Value\n2.3 Key Performance Indicators (KPIs)\n3. User Personas & Core User Stories\n3.1 Target User Personas\n3.2 Functional User Stories Matrix\n4. Functional Requirements & Scope Boundaries\n4.1 Feature Requirements & Acceptance Criteria\n4.2 Out-of-Scope (Explicit Product Exclusions)\n5. Non-Functional & Operational Requirements\n5.1 Performance & Scalability Guardrails\n5.2 Security, Privacy, & Compliance Spec\n6. Release Plan & Open Questions\n6.1 Phased Delivery Plan\n6.2 Active Risks & Open Product Decisions\n<bold>2. Executive Summary & Success Metrics</bold>\n<bold>2.1 Problem Statement & Context</bold>\n<italic>[Provide a definitive 150-word synthesis detailing the explicit customer pain points or market opportunities this feature addresses. Describe how the current application infrastructure leaves this problem unresolved and why building this capability fixes specific workflow inefficiencies.]</italic>\n<bold>2.2 Product Vision & Strategic Value</bold>\nThis capability provides a secure, low-latency mechanism to enhance standard system workflows. By introducing structured interface views and automated processing engines, the product resolves active operational blocks, improves data accessibility, and drives core platform utility for the end customer.\n<bold>2.3 Key Performance Indicators (KPIs)</bold>\nThe feature release will evaluate its product impact against three clear operational benchmarks:\n<bold><textStyle color=\"\" fontFamily=\"\" fontSize=\"null\">Adoption Rate:</textStyle></bold> At least 70% of active monthly platform tenants adopt the new module within 30 days of release.\n<bold><textStyle color=\"\" fontFamily=\"\" fontSize=\"null\">Operational Latency:</textStyle></bold> Interface updates must compile and complete processing loops inside <bold><textStyle color=\"\" fontFamily=\"\" fontSize=\"null\">300 milliseconds</textStyle></bold>.\n<bold><textStyle color=\"\" fontFamily=\"\" fontSize=\"null\">Churn Reduction:</textStyle></bold> Core customer support tickets related to this manual data block drop by 25% over Q3.\n<bold>3. User Personas & Core User Stories</bold>\n<bold>3.1 Target User Personas</bold>\n<bold><textStyle color=\"\" fontFamily=\"\" fontSize=\"null\">Persona A (The System Administrator):</textStyle></bold> Advanced user managing infrastructure configurations. Demands comprehensive logging pipelines and low-level data overrides.\n<bold><textStyle color=\"\" fontFamily=\"\" fontSize=\"null\">Persona B (The General Operator):</textStyle></bold> Casual platform user managing standard daily data entries. Prioritizes intuitive navigation paths and automated error handling.\n<bold>3.2 Functional User Stories Matrix</bold>\nID Code\nAs a / an [Actor Profile]\nI want to be able to [Action Module]\nSo that I can [Business Value Outcome]\n<bold><textStyle color=\"\" fontFamily=\"\" fontSize=\"null\">US-001</textStyle></bold>\nGeneral Operator\nSecurely log in using multi-factor tools\nProtect my sensitive data assets from outside threats.\n<bold><textStyle color=\"\" fontFamily=\"\" fontSize=\"null\">US-002</textStyle></bold>\nGeneral Operator\nUpload batch payload files up to 25MB\nIngest massive transaction matrices inside one action step.\n<bold><textStyle color=\"\" fontFamily=\"\" fontSize=\"null\">US-003</textStyle></bold>\nSystem Administrator\nExtract chronological telemetry data logs\nAudit user workflows and debug integration exceptions quickly.\n<bold>4. Functional Requirements & Scope Boundaries</bold>\n<bold>4.1 Feature Requirements & Acceptance Criteria</bold>\nFunctional parameters are cataloged using strict tracking codes with the format: <code>FR-[Module]-[Sequence]</code>.\n<bold>4.1.1 Module: Batch Data Ingestion (BDI)</bold>\n<bold><textStyle color=\"\" fontFamily=\"\" fontSize=\"null\">FR-BDI-001:</textStyle></bold> The system shall parse and validate inbound JSON payload schemas before executing data commits.\n<italic>Acceptance Criteria:</italic> Inputs violating the database schema are blocked; an HTTP 400 error returns inside 200ms.\n<bold><textStyle color=\"\" fontFamily=\"\" fontSize=\"null\">FR-BDI-002:</textStyle></bold> The system shall process batch uploads asynchronously using ring-buffered queue mechanics.\n<italic>Acceptance Criteria:</italic> Client view unlocks with an HTTP 202 code while background threads process ingestion tables.\n<bold>4.2 Out-of-Scope (Explicit Product Exclusions)</bold>\n<bold><textStyle color=\"\" fontFamily=\"\" fontSize=\"null\">Global Currency Conversion Engines:</textStyle></bold> The platform tracks metrics inside baseline formats; active real-time conversions are excluded.\n<bold><textStyle color=\"\" fontFamily=\"\" fontSize=\"null\">Legacy Desktop Installations:</textStyle></bold> Product optimization targets modern evergreen browser engines exclusively; custom native frameworks are out of scope.\n<bold>5. Non-Functional & Operational Requirements</bold>\n<bold>5.1 Performance & Scalability Guardrails</bold>\n<bold><textStyle color=\"\" fontFamily=\"\" fontSize=\"null\">P95 Throughput Latency:</textStyle></bold> Search queries must resolve and update interface components inside <bold><textStyle color=\"\" fontFamily=\"\" fontSize=\"null\">200 milliseconds</textStyle></bold> under an ordinary load volume of 500 parallel user pipelines.\n<bold><textStyle color=\"\" fontFamily=\"\" fontSize=\"null\">Resource Footprint:</textStyle></bold> Core service containers must maintain execution stability within an environment restricted to 2 CPU Cores and 4GB RAM.\n<bold>5.2 Security, Privacy, & Compliance Spec</bold>\n<bold><textStyle color=\"\" fontFamily=\"\" fontSize=\"null\">At-Rest Encryption Protection:</textStyle></bold> All customer identity entries and structural transaction records must use the <bold><textStyle color=\"\" fontFamily=\"\" fontSize=\"null\">AES-256 standard</textStyle></bold>.\n<bold><textStyle color=\"\" fontFamily=\"\" fontSize=\"null\">Transport Protection Configuration:</textStyle></bold> The platform edge gateway rejects any connection that does not present a valid TLS 1.3 encryption configuration layer.\n<bold>6. Release Plan & Open Questions</bold>\n<bold>6.2 Phased Delivery Plan</bold>\n<bold><textStyle color=\"\" fontFamily=\"\" fontSize=\"null\">Phase 1 (Alpha):</textStyle></bold> Deployment of core backend microservice routes and database validation tables to staging servers (Target: Sprint 14).\n<bold><textStyle color=\"\" fontFamily=\"\" fontSize=\"null\">Phase 2 (Beta):</textStyle></bold> Deployment of frontend UI view components and end-to-end telemetry monitoring hooks to internal users (Target: Sprint 15).\n<bold><textStyle color=\"\" fontFamily=\"\" fontSize=\"null\">Phase 3 (GA):</textStyle></bold> Full production rollout to all external client organizations with automated onboarding flows enabled (Target: Sprint 16).\n<bold>6.3 Active Risks & Open Product Decisions</bold>\nRisk ID\nIdentified Risk Description\nImpact\nProbability\nProactive Mitigation Strategy\n<bold><textStyle color=\"\" fontFamily=\"\" fontSize=\"null\">PR-01</textStyle></bold>\nThird-party interface API deprecates its transport configurations.\nHigh\nLow\nBuild custom interface abstraction layers to decouple internal routes from external updates.\n<bold><textStyle color=\"\" fontFamily=\"\" fontSize=\"null\">PR-02</textStyle></bold>\nHeavy batch uploads cause thread saturation on processing instances.\nMedium\nMedium\nConfigure fixed thread pool limits that match available hardware core specs perfectly.",
  "blocks": []
}